{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"661248","name":"The Alex","description":"The Alex is located in the cosmopolitan riviera on Kastella's Hill overlooking Microlimano 'little harbor', lined with fishing boats, ritzy yachts & fancy seafood restaurants. Its subtle hospitality concept engages modern urbanists. Set in Piraeus, 3. 2 km from Piraeus Port - Athens, The Alex offers accommodation with a bar, private parking and a terrace. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a 24-hour front desk and room service, along with free WiFi throughout the property. The property is 2. 1 km from Peace & Friendship Stadium and 2. 7 km from Karaiskaki Stadium. The units come with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, a kettle, a bidet, a hairdryer and a desk. The private bathroom is equipped with a shower and free toiletries. The hotel offers a à la carte or gluten-free breakfast. TEI Piraeus is 7 km from The Alex, while Veakeio Theatre is 1. 6 km away. The nearest airport is Elefthérios Venizélos Airport, 42 km from the accommodation.","address":"Alexandrou Papanastasiou, 109","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"18533","lat":37.939717,"lng":23.6615,"stars":4,"giataCode":"1102847","phone":"+302104175108","email":"reservations@santikoscollection.com","website":"www.sanntikoscollection/thealex","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/661248/661248a_hb_a_008.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/661248/661248a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/661248/661248a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/661248/661248a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/661248/661248a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/66/661248